Problem

The 0G INFT Platform's inference system had several critical issues preventing proper non-custodial operation:

Broken Request Flow: Despite USE_NONCUSTODIAL_INFERENCE=true being set, the API was not enforcing non-custodial mode due to environment variable loading issues in Next.js API routes
Missing Logging: Required logging points ([CHAT] start, [CHAT] prepared, [CHAT] fetch, [CHAT] HIT, [PROXY] HIT) were incomplete
No Ledger Balance Display: Users had no visibility into their 0G Ledger account balance or ability to top up funds
UI Contrast Issues: Agent card buttons were using white/semi-transparent styling that was difficult to read
Solution

1. Fixed Non-Custodial Mode Enforcement

Updated next.config.js to properly load .env.local variables into the server runtime:

// Load both .env.local and .env files
require('dotenv').config({ path: '.env.local' })
require('dotenv').config({ path: '.env' })

// Explicitly pass variables to server environment
env: {
  USE_NONCUSTODIAL_INFERENCE: process.env.USE_NONCUSTODIAL_INFERENCE || 'false',
  ENABLE_FINE_TUNE: process.env.ENABLE_FINE_TUNE || 'false',
}
Modified /api/compute/chat/route.ts to properly enforce non-custodial mode:

// Check if non-custodial mode is enforced
const useNonCustodial = process.env.USE_NONCUSTODIAL_INFERENCE === 'true'
if (useNonCustodial) {
  return NextResponse.json({
    success: false, 
    error: 'non_custodial_required',
    message: 'Non-custodial mode is enabled but no prepared request provided. Please connect wallet and try again.'
  }, { status: 400 })
}
2. Complete Logging Implementation

Added comprehensive logging throughout the request flow:

Frontend (useNonCustodialChat.ts):

[CHAT] start - Request initiation
[CHAT] prepared - Request preparation complete
[CHAT] fetch - Sending to server
Backend API routes:

[CHAT] HIT - Chat route processing prepared requests
[PROXY] HIT - Proxy forwarding to 0G providers
Environment validation logging for debugging
3. Ledger Balance Component

Created a comprehensive LedgerBalance.tsx component with:

Compact View: For integration in chat sidebar showing balance and quick top-up
Full View: Complete balance management interface with detailed controls
Auto-Detection: Automatically detects wallet connection and ledger existence
Top-up Functionality: Seamless ETH-to-ledger transfers using 0G SDK
State Management: Loading, creating, topping up, and error states
