// After: 
className="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/25"
Enhanced Contrast: Improved readability across all components while maintaining the purple gradient theme.

Testing & Verification

Created a comprehensive test dashboard at /test-inference that validates:

